<cfinclude template="includes/start.cfm">
<cfscript>
teamSlug=teamBoundary.text(URL,'team');teamSearch=left(teamBoundary.text(URL,'q'),100);teamUf=teamBoundary.text(URL,'uf');teamType=teamBoundary.text(URL,'type');teamPage=max(1,teamBoundary.number(URL,'page',1));
selectedTeam={};directory=queryNew('id_team,slug,name,type,city,uf,attendance,description,total_count');athleteState={teamId=0,name='',slug='',blocked=false,nextChangeAt=''};
if(CGI.request_method=='POST'){
 try {teamPost();if(teamBoundary.text(FORM,'operation')!='join')throw(type='Teams.Validation',message='Operação inválida.');teamSvc.join(teamUser.id,teamBoundary.number(FORM,'team_id'),teamBoundary.text(FORM,'consent')=='yes');cfheader(statuscode=303);cfheader(name='Location',value='/teams/meu-team/?joined=1');abort;}
 catch(Teams.Validation failed){teamError=failed.message;}catch(Teams.Forbidden failed){cfheader(statuscode=403);teamError=failed.message;}catch(any failed){writeLog(file='teams',type='error',text='join_failed type=' & failed.type);teamError='Não foi possível confirmar o vínculo. Tente novamente.';}
}
if(teamReady){if(len(teamSlug)){selectedTeam=teamSvc.publicTeam(teamSlug);if(structIsEmpty(selectedTeam)){cfheader(statuscode=404);teamError='Este Team não está disponível para adesão.';}else teamTitle=selectedTeam.name & ' · Road Runners Teams';}
else directory=teamSvc.publicTeams(teamSearch,teamUf,teamType,teamPage);
if(!structIsEmpty(teamUser))athleteState=teamSvc.state(teamUser.id);}
</cfscript>
<cfinclude template="includes/header.cfm">
<cfif len(teamSlug)>
<cfif NOT structIsEmpty(selectedTeam)>
<section class="teams-hero"><a href="/teams/">← Encontrar outro Team</a><p class="teams-eyebrow"><cfoutput>#encodeForHTML(teamTypeLabels[selectedTeam.type])#</cfoutput></p><h1><cfoutput>#encodeForHTML(selectedTeam.name)#</cfoutput></h1><p class="teams-muted"><cfoutput>#encodeForHTML(selectedTeam.city)# / #encodeForHTML(selectedTeam.uf)#</cfoutput> · <cfif selectedTeam.attendance EQ 'AMBOS'>Presencial e online<cfelseif selectedTeam.attendance EQ 'ONLINE'>Online<cfelse>Presencial</cfif></p></section>
<div class="teams-grid"><section class="teams-panel"><h2>Conheça o Team</h2><p><cfoutput>#encodeForHTML(selectedTeam.description)#</cfoutput></p><p class="teams-small teams-muted">Responsável técnico: <cfoutput>#encodeForHTML(selectedTeam.technical_name)# · CREF #encodeForHTML(selectedTeam.cref)# / #encodeForHTML(selectedTeam.cref_uf)#</cfoutput></p><cfif len(selectedTeam.website)><a href="<cfoutput>#encodeForHTMLAttribute(selectedTeam.website)#</cfoutput>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Site ou rede social do Team</a></cfif></section>
<section class="teams-panel"><h2>Represente este Team</h2>
<cfif structIsEmpty(teamUser)><p>Entre ou crie sua conta no RR para escolher seu Team.</p><a class="teams-button" href="/teams/entrar/?redirect=<cfoutput>#urlEncodedFormat('/teams/?team=' & selectedTeam.slug)#</cfoutput>">Entrar e continuar</a>
<cfelseif athleteState.teamId EQ selectedTeam.id_team><p>Você já representa este Team.</p><a class="teams-button secondary" href="/teams/meu-team/">Gerenciar meu vínculo</a>
<cfelseif athleteState.blocked><p>Sua próxima adesão ou troca estará disponível em <strong><cfoutput>#encodeForHTML(athleteState.nextChangeAt)#</cfoutput></strong>, horário de Brasília.</p><a href="/teams/meu-team/">Ver meu Team</a>
<cfelse><cfif athleteState.teamId GT 0><div class="teams-alert">Ao confirmar, você deixará <strong><cfoutput>#encodeForHTML(athleteState.name)#</cfoutput></strong> e passará a representar este Team.</div></cfif>
<form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<cfoutput>#teamCsrf#</cfoutput>"><input type="hidden" name="operation" value="join"><input type="hidden" name="team_id" value="<cfoutput>#selectedTeam.id_team#</cfoutput>"><label class="teams-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>Quero representar este Team e autorizo seus administradores a acompanhar meu perfil esportivo e os resultados de provas disponíveis no RR enquanto eu estiver vinculado. Entendo que só posso representar um Team e que uma nova adesão ou troca exige 14 dias completos.</span></label><p class="teams-small teams-muted">Você pode sair a qualquer momento. A saída não antecipa a próxima troca.</p><button>Confirmar vínculo com o Team</button></form>
</cfif></section></div>
</cfif>
<cfelse>
<section class="teams-hero"><span class="teams-eyebrow">Road Runners Teams</span><h1>Todo corredor tem uma história.<br>Qual é o seu time?</h1><p>Encontre sua assessoria, treinador ou grupo de corrida e represente sua comunidade no RR.</p><p class="teams-small teams-muted">Você também pode continuar correndo sem Team. Sua experiência no RR permanece disponível.</p></section>
<form class="teams-toolbar" method="get"><label>Nome ou cidade<input name="q" maxlength="100" value="<cfoutput>#encodeForHTMLAttribute(teamSearch)#</cfoutput>" placeholder="Encontre sua comunidade"></label><label>UF<input name="uf" maxlength="2" value="<cfoutput>#encodeForHTMLAttribute(teamUf)#</cfoutput>" placeholder="Todas"></label><label>Tipo<select name="type"><option value="">Todos</option><cfoutput><cfloop collection="#teamTypeLabels#" item="typeKey"><option value="#typeKey#" <cfif teamType EQ typeKey>selected</cfif>>#encodeForHTML(teamTypeLabels[typeKey])#</option></cfloop></cfoutput></select></label><button>Buscar Teams</button></form>
<cfif NOT directory.recordCount><section class="teams-panel"><h2>Nenhum Team encontrado</h2><p>Seu time ainda pode estar chegando ao RR. Convide o responsável para cadastrar a comunidade.</p><a class="teams-button secondary" href="/teams/convidar/">Convidar meu Team</a></section><cfelse><div class="teams-grid"><cfoutput query="directory"><article class="teams-panel teams-card"><span class="teams-badge">#encodeForHTML(teamTypeLabels[type])#</span><h2>#encodeForHTML(name)#</h2><p class="teams-muted">#encodeForHTML(city)# / #encodeForHTML(uf)#</p><p>#encodeForHTML(left(description,180))#</p><a class="teams-button secondary" href="?team=#urlEncodedFormat(slug)#">Conhecer Team</a></article></cfoutput></div><nav class="teams-pagination" aria-label="Paginação"><cfif teamPage GT 1><a href="?page=<cfoutput>#teamPage-1#&q=#urlEncodedFormat(teamSearch)#&uf=#urlEncodedFormat(teamUf)#&type=#urlEncodedFormat(teamType)#</cfoutput>">Anterior</a></cfif><cfif directory.recordCount EQ 24><a href="?page=<cfoutput>#teamPage+1#&q=#urlEncodedFormat(teamSearch)#&uf=#urlEncodedFormat(teamUf)#&type=#urlEncodedFormat(teamType)#</cfoutput>">Próxima</a></cfif></nav></cfif>
<section class="teams-panel"><h2>Seu time ainda não está aqui?</h2><p>Convide o responsável pelo cadastro ou conheça o programa para treinadores, assessorias, clubes e grupos.</p><div class="teams-inline"><a href="/teams/convidar/">Convidar responsável</a><a href="https://business.roadrunners.run/teams/cadastro/">Cadastrar um Team</a></div></section>
</cfif>
<cfinclude template="includes/footer.cfm">
